{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Overview\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat formidable enemies infesting <strong>abandoned school\u00a0</strong>and <strong>rescue the girl</strong> trapped in her youth!<br><strong>No exploration</strong>, <strong>No normal-enemy battles!</strong><br>This is a 2D shooting action game focused solely on <strong>Boss Fights!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122200/extras/80469cd0daa3166949734ed6ac927367.poster.avif?t=1761463907\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122200/extras/80469cd0daa3166949734ed6ac927367.webm?t=1761463907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122200/extras/80469cd0daa3166949734ed6ac927367.mp4?t=1761463907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Game System\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>You cannot attack first!</strong></i><br>Identify the <strong>\u201cBlue bullets\u201d</strong> fired by enemies, <strong>Catch them</strong>, and <strong>Shoot</strong>\u00a0<strong>them back</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122200/extras/1dda94397c8698da3abcb43d8c2b6c73.poster.avif?t=1761463907\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122200/extras/1dda94397c8698da3abcb43d8c2b6c73.webm?t=1761463907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122200/extras/1dda94397c8698da3abcb43d8c2b6c73.mp4?t=1761463907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Story\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You, possessing special powers, and your partner head to an abandoned school to rescue a missing girl.</i><br><br><i>Thinking it would be a quick job as usual, you two are trapped inside the school building by the unexpected power of the monsters.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Can you defeat all the monsters and rescue the girl?!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And what is <strong>the strange connection between the girl and you...?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122200/extras/44fb5c3f6b7aff49791719ca6a00e45b.poster.avif?t=1761463907\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122200/extras/44fb5c3f6b7aff49791719ca6a00e45b.webm?t=1761463907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122200/extras/44fb5c3f6b7aff49791719ca6a00e45b.mp4?t=1761463907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4122200?t=1761463907","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122200/a2305e24f2697ad06ec1da4ad06541d44c0989fd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761463907","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122200/d15f2006a800faabb4d0cf83683c8e1c38e8c728/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761463907","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122200/d15f2006a800faabb4d0cf83683c8e1c38e8c728/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761463907","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support"